    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "YES_NO",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes.\nNo.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "hungry",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Serph and the party feel hungry...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "hungry02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> They grew weak from hunger.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "sera_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This is so cool, Serph!\nCan I... go up to the top?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "sera_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sure, why not?\nSave it for later.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "sera_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Thank you, Serph.\nShips like this are actually\nsupposed to float...\n...in the ocean, I think.\nThe ocean is so vast and\nbeautiful... the water gently\nrocking back and forth...\nCome on, let's go!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "sera_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Oh, okay...\nI can be patient.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "sera_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'd love to go see... the ocean.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "heat_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hey, Serph... Does it feel like\nyou've seen this hunk of junk\nbefore?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "heat_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Actually, yeah...\nNo. We've never seen this before.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "heat_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You think so, too...\nSera, Argilla, Cielo--all of us...\nDoesn't it feel like we've been\non this thing before?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "heat_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That would make sense, but...\nIt's just like everything else.\nSomething's not right...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "arujila_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That's a ship, isn't it?\nDon't they float... in the...\n...ocean?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "gale_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What is this?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "gale_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's called a ship.\nI don't know. What is it?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "gale_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I know that.\nIn addition, I know that it is\na seafaring vessel.\nBut, why is it here?\nAnd the fact that I know about it...\nHow can that be...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "gale_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I have never seen this before, but\nit resembles a warship.\nThat is simple to understand...\nBut, why would such a craft be\nlandlocked here?\nAnd the fact that I know about warships...\nHow can that be...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "ciero_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Look at Sera, bro.\nShe look so happy...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "ciero_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What was dat, before... crying?\nHer happy face seems ta fit her\nmore dan a crying one.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "npc_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, we're setting a trap here,\ncorrect? Don't forget to stock\nup on items before the mission.\nThere probably won't be time to\nreturn for more.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "npc_01_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'm ready.\nYou're right...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "npc_01_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We are fighting against the Brutes.\nIt may be a battle with death\nitself, but... don't die.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "npc_01_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Well then, there's no time\nto lose.\nReplenish your supplies at once.\nThere's no telling when they're\ngoing to attack!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "EXITWARP",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Leave the area?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
